---
---

<footer class="border-t border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 py-12 sm:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-black text-[13px] sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top Brand & Scientific Foundation Row -->
    <div class="pb-10 mb-10 border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <a href="/ja/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5 group transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.98]" aria-label="FreeIQExam 日本語トップ">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="16" cy="9.5" r="5.5" class="fill-[#0066cc] dark:fill-[#2997ff]" />
            <circle cx="8" cy="23" r="4.8" class="fill-blue-700 dark:fill-blue-600" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="23" r="4.8" class="fill-sky-400 dark:fill-sky-400" />
          </svg>
          <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
            Free<span class="text-[#0066cc] dark:text-[#2997ff]">IQ</span>Exam
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          現代の心理測定科学と項目応答理論（2PL IRT）に基づく認知機能スクリーニングおよびライフスタイル測定ツール。登録不要・完全無料で利用できます。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0 text-[13px]">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200/60 dark:border-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 font-medium">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0066cc] dark:bg-[#2997ff] animate-pulse"></span>
          2PL IRT 理論準拠
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-700/80 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 font-medium">
          登録不要・完全無料
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Structured Semantic Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Column 1: 知能・論理思考 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
            <path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8" />
          </svg>
          <span>知能・論理思考</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/iq-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">無料IQテスト（24問・20分）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/mensa-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">メンサ向け練習テスト（高難度）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/color-blind-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">色覚テスト（石原式22枚）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/hearing-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">オンライン聴力検査（周波数）</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: メンタルヘルス・発達スクリーニング -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z" />
          </svg>
          <span>メンタルヘルス・発達</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/adhd-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">大人のADHDチェック（ASRS v1.1）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/autism-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">自閉スペクトラム症チェック（AQ-10）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/depression-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">うつ病セルフチェック（PHQ-9）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/depression-test#support" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">メンタルヘルス相談窓口案内</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: スピード・感覚・ゲーム -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="6" />
            <path d="M6 12h4m-2-2v4m10-2h.01M14 10h.01" />
          </svg>
          <span>スピード・感覚・ゲーム</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/typing-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">タイピング練習・速度測定</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/reaction-time-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">反射神経テスト（ミリ秒計測）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/cps-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">CPSテスト（クリック速度測定）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/flag-quiz" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">国旗クイズ（世界195カ国）</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: 健康・ライフスタイル・哲学 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" />
            <path d="M8 6h8M8 11h.01M12 11h.01M16 11h.01M8 15h.01M12 15h.01M16 15h.01M8 19h.01M12 19h.01M16 19h.01" />
          </svg>
          <span>健康・ライフスタイル・哲学</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/calorie-calculator" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">基礎代謝・カロリー計算（TDEE）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/white-noise" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">ホワイトノイズ音源生成器</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/memento-mori" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">メメントモリ人生時計（残り週数）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/" class="text-[#0066cc] dark:text-[#2997ff] hover:underline transition-colors font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">すべてのツール一覧 <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright Row -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-500">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4">
        <span>&copy; 2026 FreeIQExam. All rights reserved.</span>
        <span>&bull;</span>
        <span>自己観察および教育目的のオンラインツールです</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors">プライバシーポリシー</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors">利用規約</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors">お問い合わせ</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
